<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>&nbsp;</b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Right now, the Red Cross has an immediate need for blood</b>. Thank
you for working hard to organize your upcoming blood drive.<b> </b>Your blood
drive plays an important role during this time to ensure there are no delays in
medical treatment for patients in need.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>&nbsp;</b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Seasons may change, but the constant need for donors
doesn’t. We need more donors to come forward to prevent the blood supply from
falling to lower levels. When donors come to give Oct. 1-20 the Red Cross will
say thanks with a $15 Amazon.com Gift Card** by email.*<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">As you continue the work to make your drive a success –
remember to use these tips:</p><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Fill
     your schedule.</b> Use these tools to recruit blood donors and schedule them
     using the Blood Drive Management Portal.<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Encourage
     donors to schedule a donation for a friend.</b> Each additional donor
     scheduled means more lives saved!<o:p></o:p></li>
</ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach
out – I’m always here to help!<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>IMPORTANT: Donors MUST have a valid email address on file
to receive their reward. <o:p></o:p></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">All the best, <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</font><br><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 16.8pt; background: white;"><span class="fontsizexsmall"><span style="font-size:7.5pt;
font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424">**Restrictions apply,
see&nbsp;</span></span><strong><u><span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:
&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424">amazon.com/gc-legal</span></u></strong><span class="fontsizexsmall"><span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#242424">.</span></span><span style="font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#242424"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 16.8pt; background: white; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><span class="fontsizexsmall"><span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424">*Presenting
donors who receive this offer and present to donate during the applicable
promotional time frame are eligible to receive the above described e-gift
card(s). This offer is non-transferable and not redeemable for cash. Limit one
(1) per presenting donor unless otherwise indicated. If a presenting donor
qualifies for multiple offers, the donor will only receive the higher offer
unless otherwise indicated. Instructions on how to redeem the gift card will be
emailed to the address listed on the presenting donor’s American Red Cross
donor profile approximately thirty (30) days after attempted donation(s). All
gift cards are subject to individual merchant terms and conditions, and all
trademarks are property of their respective owners. Merchants and offers are
subject to change. No substitutions by presenting donors. American Red Cross is
not responsible for lost, damaged, corrupted or stolen gift cards and may
replace any such cards at its sole discretion. Any questions or problems in
connection with redeeming gift cards must be directed to the merchant.</span></span><span style="font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">









































</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

